    "Name": "Dragon Fire DGR-9D",
    "Details": "A 28th century design that first saw production in 3058, the Dragon Fire is a 75-ton mech designed for brawling. The DRG-9D is armed with a Gauss Rifle and a RAC/5, with a Clan spec ER PPC and a pair of Clan spec ER Medium Lasers as secondary weapons. A 300-rated XL Engine and an Endo-Composite Skeleton provide the weight needed for the heavy payload.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
